==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*sъnęti}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*sъ(n)-}} (see {{m|sla-pro|*sъ(n)}}) + {{m|sla-pro|*ęti}}. [[Appendix:Glossary#reanalysis|Reanalyzed]] as {{m|ru|с-}} + {{m|ru|-нять}}, from which other words in {{m|ru|-нять}} were created, such as {{m|ru|наня́ть}}, {{m|ru|обня́ть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-снять.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|сня́ть|pf|impf=снима́ть}}

# to [[take off]], to [[take away]], to [[take down]]
# to [[take]], to [[make]]
# to [[photograph]], to [[film]]
# to [[rent]] {{gloss|e.g. an apartment}}

